			"value": " A single type argument that is one object-like type (a type reference or an",
			"start": 20,
			"end": 98
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " object type) united only with `null` / `void` does not break inside the `<>`:",
			"start": 100,
			"end": 180
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " when the call's `(` fits the arguments break, else the line breaks after the `=`.",
			"start": 182,
			"end": 266
		},
		{
